WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.990
- Brendan, you got, you got
a six minute standing ovation

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:06.908
when 'The Whale' premiered
at the Venice Film Festival.

00:00:06.908 --> 00:00:09.060
How did that feel?

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:12.033
I mean, you seemed so overwhelmed.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:14.970
- Correct.

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.910
- Yeah. It had to be just so overwhelming

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.533
and that role was so important.

00:00:21.052 --> 00:00:25.537
- I felt really affirmed,
surprised, astonished

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:29.262
and a little bit Italian.

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:31.679
- (laughing)

00:00:32.807 --> 00:00:35.313
You're always welcome on this show.

00:00:36.441 --> 00:00:39.191
(crowd cheering)

00:00:40.041 --> 00:00:41.760
What, what, instead of asking him

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.320
because he was obviously experiencing,

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:44.730
what was it like to watch

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.800
'cause you've been shooting
this movie with him

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.060
and going through these
very intense scenes,

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:49.500
like you said you're like
always yelling at him

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.820
and you're, you know, very angry.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:53.970
Like, what was it like
to watch that happen?

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:55.470
- I was a little nervous.

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:59.160
That was the first time we'd
showed it to an audience,

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.290
so I think we were all a little relieved

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:03.390
that they were clapping and standing and-

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:04.223
- [Kelly] Responded so.

00:01:04.223 --> 00:01:05.056
- [Female Guest] And responded.

00:01:05.056 --> 00:01:06.240
- Yeah.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:07.140
Oh, that's intense.

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:08.610
I didn't realize it was the first time.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:12.434
- Yeah, it's very nerve
wracking, but it turned out well.

00:01:12.434 --> 00:01:13.590
- Oh God would never
want to experience that

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:15.858
in front, the first time
in front of ton of people.

00:01:15.858 --> 00:01:17.463
That's brave.

